{"id":"nativo","lemma":"nativo","pos":"adj","rank":4831,"glosses":["native"],"ipa":"/naˈtibo/","forms":{"feminine":"nativa","masculinePlural":"nativos","femininePlural":"nativas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-nativo.wav","examples":[{"text":"No soy hablante nativo.","en":"I'm not a native speaker.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516315","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null]},{"text":"Los nativos están descontentos hoy.","en":"The natives are restless today.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"unhappy, discontented","l":"descontento"},{"g":"today, tonight"}]},{"text":"Mi idioma nativo es el francés.","en":"My native language is French.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515989","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"language"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"Los nativos se están poniendo intranquilos.","en":"The natives are getting restless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804273","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},null]},{"text":"Tengo muchos amigos que son hablantes nativos.","en":"I have many friends who are native speakers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553820","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"friend","l":"amigo"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null]}]}